title: Change the Central Executive Committee
subtitle: The final composition of its three seats, in one decision.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: {! return !!Q.S && !!Q.polish_party_rules && PolishParty.advisersAvailable(Q) !}
on-arrival: {!
// Card party.advisers (technical reference 10.4.2; card catalogue 6.5; Z — 0.35: a separate card): 1 T,
// cd 6 M; it does not reset the adviser cooldown. Próchnik, Drobner and Dubois belong to the continuation.
Q.pl_adv_draft = PolishParty.activeAdvisers(Q).join(',');
PolishParty.advisersView(Q);
!}

= Change the Central Executive Committee

The present Committee: [+ pl_adv_draft_text +]. A first appointment strengthens the person's faction (+5 strength, −5 dissent); a dismissal adds +5 dissent; a return gives nothing new.

- @compose
- @easy_discard

@compose
title: Compose the Committee
go-to: menu

@menu
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.advisersView(Q);
!}

= The new Committee

Chosen: [+ pl_adv_draft_text +]. Nothing is spent until you confirm.

- @toggle_daszynski
- @toggle_puzak
- @toggle_perl
- @toggle_niedzialkowski
- @toggle_arciszewski
- @toggle_zaremba
- @toggle_czapinski
- @toggle_jaworowski
- @toggle_moraczewski
- @toggle_ziemiecki
- @toggle_malinowski
- @confirm
- @polish_party_advisers: Start again.

@toggle_daszynski
title: Ignacy Daszyński (Centrum)
subtitle: [? if pl_adv_daszynski_in = 1 : On the Committee — remove. ?][? if pl_adv_daszynski_in = 0 : Add to the Committee. ?]
choose-if: pl_adv_daszynski_in = 1 or pl_adv_daszynski_can_add = 1
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_adv_daszynski_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.advisersToggle(Q, 'daszynski');
!}
go-to: menu

